#    The guarded remainder generated by divide_loop above ensures
#    correctness for arbitrary n and is left as a short scalar loop.
ji = kernel_gesummv_scheduled.find_loop("ji")
kernel_gesummv_scheduled = unroll_loop(kernel_gesummv_scheduled, ji)

